{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is visible, approach and grab it. Check its properties, move it to destination and perform specific task. Otherwise, scan area for object. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = MoveObjectToDestination    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    />\"",
